    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "EDFacts catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** U.S. Department of Education.\n- **Access:** Custom CSV downloads and released ZIP files with data notes.\n- **Unit:** Education agency or school, annual and subgroup-disaggregated.\n- **Coverage:** Varies by file specification and outcome; record school year and data group.\n- **Join keys:** State, LEA ID, school ID, school year, and subgroup.\n- **Measures:** Assessment, graduation, chronic absence, accountability, CTE, and English-learner progress.\n- **Use boundary:** Preserve file specification, data notes, suppression rules, and denominator with every extract.\n\nEDFacts can provide attendance, graduation, subgroup, implementation, and accountability context. Its released values do not alone establish that a program caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
